o the greased paper, join-side down (you might find a flat baking sheet helpful for this), loosely bring up the paper and foil around it, then scrunch together along the edges and ends to seal. The roly-poly will puff quite a bit during cooking so don’t wrap it tightly. Lift the parcel directly onto the rack above the tin and cook for 1 hr.","durationMin":3,"timerSeconds":180,"activeMeasureSummary":"Milk, Raspberry Jam"},{"stepNumber":4,"phaseLabel":"Bake / Chill","title":"Bake / Chill: Jam Roly-Poly","instructionTemplate":"Let the pudding sit for 5 mins before unwrapping, then carefully open the foil and paper, and thickly slice to serve. Plate into 4 generous servings while the flavors and textures are at their peak, and store any leftovers covered.","durationMin":30,"timerSeconds":1800,"activeMeasureSummary":"Custard","criticalTip":"Let set for 5–10 minutes before slicing or plating so the textures hold crisp and photogenic!","creatorSecret":"Measure aromatics and syrups before heating so timing stays crisp and your glaze hits glossy perfection."}],"ugcQuotes":[{"id":"muq-52890","handle":"@baker_jam-roly","image":"./ai-images/jam-roly-poly.jpg","quote":"Followed the scaled metric steps—came out flawless in 45 mins!","rating":5}],"isHealthy":true}}]
